ome from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default notification center.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack\/progress"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack(py)progress","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"progress","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"progress"}],"fragments":[{"text":"progress","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack/progress":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The pack’s current progress.","type":"text"}],"title":"progress","fragments":[{"text":"progress","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack\/progress","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/progress","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePack"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNOfflinePack","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" represents a collection of resources necessary for viewing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a region offline to a local database."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackprogresschangednotification","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification"}],"title":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Posted by the shared "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object when an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object’s progress changes. The progress may change due to a resource being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded or because the pack discovers during the download that more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources are required for offline viewing. This notification is posted"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"whenever any field in the "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property changes.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackProgress":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackProgress"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNOfflinePackProgress","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackprogress","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgress","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A structure containing information about an offline pack’s current download"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MLNOfflineStorage","abstract":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its ","type":"text"},{"code":"packs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}}}